Bundled third-party component: sing-box

The installers and dev builds distributed by this project bundle an
unmodified sing-box binary (https://github.com/SagerNet/sing-box), which is
licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0:

    https://github.com/SagerNet/sing-box/blob/main/LICENSE

sing-box is invoked as a separate process over a documented interface; it is
neither linked into nor derived from the Apache-2.0 licensed code in this
repository, and the two are distributed together as an aggregation. The exact
version bundled by any given build is pinned in
src/main/resources/singbox.properties, and its corresponding source is
available from the upstream repository above.

