Bundled third-party components: the Java runtime and libraries

The installers (DMG / MSI / DEB) are jpackage images: a Java runtime produced
by jlink, the application jar with the libraries below, and the sing-box
binary above. The Maven coordinates are those of pom.xml, where the versions
are pinned; the release workflow builds with the Eclipse Temurin JDK.

