Data downloaded at runtime: DB-IP IP to Country Lite

The application downloads the "IP to Country Lite" database published by
DB-IP (https://db-ip.com/db/download/ip-to-country-lite) at runtime, for
local IP-to-country lookups behind the server flags. It is not part of the
installers; the application fetches the current monthly file itself.

    License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0),
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

CC BY 4.0 requires attribution. This product attributes the data as
"IP Geolocation by DB-IP" (https://db-ip.com) here and in the application,
under Settings -> About.
